# Preserve upstream legal texts and matching-host generated Windows package
# metadata byte-for-byte. Their source formatting is part of the release input.
coakka-http-runtime/**/third-party-licenses/** -text -diff
coakka-http-runtime/native/releases/*/windows-*/lib/cmake/CoAkkaHttp/*.cmake -text -diff

# The installed public test suite is verified against byte-exact SHA-256
# digests. Keep its source bytes stable when Windows enables core.autocrlf.
coakka-http-runtime/runtime-test/** text eol=lf
